# LOBBY CAM environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local dev, or paste these into Railway's
# "Variables" tab for production. Both are OPTIONAL — the site runs in demo
# mode without them and each feed "lights up" once its key is present. Check
# which feeds are live at /status.
#
# ONE free api.data.gov key powers BOTH variables below — sign up once at
# https://api.data.gov/signup/ and paste the same value into each.
#
# See docs/ENV_SETUP.md for step-by-step instructions.

# Bills & floor schedule (Congress.gov).
CONGRESS_GOV_API_KEY=

# Campaign filings + donor-money-by-industry (FEC). Same api.data.gov key.
# Donor industries are derived by matching FEC PAC filings against LOBBY CAM's
# curated industry map (lib/industryMap.ts) — this replaced OpenSecrets, whose
# API was retired in April 2025.
FEC_API_KEY=
